Code Meaning 0 Every verified bundle returned <code>ok</code>. 2 The argument shape was wrong (e.g. <code>CatalogError</code> finding the run). 3 At least one bundle reported a mismatch or a per-run error. 64 Neither <code>RUN_ID</code> nor <code>--all</code> was supplied. <p>Recommended CI pattern — nightly integrity sweep:</p> <pre><code>uv run capa catalog verify --all --runs-root /data/runs || {
    echo "INTEGRITY FAILURE — investigate" ; exit 3 ;
}
</code></pre> <p>Exit 3 is the signal to stop the line. Treat it as severely as a <code>capa run</code> exit 3.</p>
